<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6414" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάδασ-τος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>divided anew, redistributed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. γῆν ποιεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					843b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ποιεῖν τὴν χώραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1307a2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς οὐσίας ἀ. ποιεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1305a5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1309a15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> later,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ποιεῖν τι</span>
			<i>undo, rescind</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				669.20
			</span></i> (Egypt, <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>), 
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Abd.</u>
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως: ἀνωμάλως ἔχων τις τοῦ σώματος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
